  <rdf:Description rdf:nodeID="commodity_pauntener_cb0">
    <crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>small bag, wallet, purse made of the skin of a roe: a small species of deer (capreolus capraea) inhabiting various parts of Europe and Asia (OED s.v. roe1); small bag, wallet, purse (OED s.v. pautener n.2)</crm:P190_has_symbolic_content>
